msgstr "您還沒有登入，所以這是範例家庭。"

#: app/(tabs)/you.tsx
msgid "You are paused: no turns come to you, and you are not told if it goes quiet."
msgstr "您目前暫停中：不會輪到您提問，安靜的日子也不會通知您。"

#: app/(tabs)/you.tsx
msgid "You are paused: no turns come to you."
msgstr "您目前暫停中：不會輪到您提問。"

#: src/data/useFamily.ts
msgid "You are the only organiser who is active, and an organiser who is away is not told if it goes quiet. Someone else who organises the family has to be active first."
msgstr "目前只有您一位發起人在使用中，而暫停的發起人在安靜的日子不會收到通知。必須先有這個家庭的另一位發起人在使用中。"

#: app/exchange/[id].tsx
msgid "You can reply once she has answered."
msgstr "等這位家人回覆之後，您就可以回應。"

#: app/(tabs)/index.tsx
msgid "You said {name} is fine. Nothing else was sent."
msgstr "您說{name}沒事。沒有再傳送其他訊息。"

#: app/(tabs)/you.tsx
msgid "You will stop seeing the family's days and taking turns. Thirty days on, what is kept about you is deleted."
msgstr "您將不再看到家人的日常，也不會再輪流提問。三十天後，保存的關於您的資料會被刪除。"

#: app/(tabs)/you.tsx
msgid "Your account id. Nobody but you needs it."
msgstr "您的帳號 ID。只有您自己會用到。"

#: app/(tabs)/you.tsx
msgid "Your family could not be reached just now, so this is the example one."
msgstr "目前無法載入您的家庭，所以這裡顯示的是範例家庭。"

#: app/(tabs)/you.tsx
msgid "Your family could not be reached just now."
msgstr "目前無法載入您的家庭。"

#: app/(tabs)/you.tsx
msgid "Your light is off, so nothing about your mornings is shown."
msgstr "您的燈沒有亮著，所以不會顯示任何關於您早上的內容。"

#: src/data/useFamily.ts
